    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/legacy-book-club/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Legacy Book Club is an elegant, feature-rich, and versatile theme crafted for book clubs, literary communities, reading circles, online book forums, book lovers’ networks, libraries, book cafés, bookstores, online bookstores, secondhand book shops, vintage book stores, children’s book stores, eBook stores, and literary event organizers. Ideal for authors, publishers, and literature enthusiasts, this theme provides a platform to share book reviews, recommendations, discussion topics, author interviews, reading challenges, and upcoming book releases. It offers a clean, responsive, and retina-ready layout that performs flawlessly across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, ensuring an immersive reading experience. Integrated with the Bookly plugin for event scheduling, membership registration, and author meetups, and compatible with WooCommerce for online book sales and preorders, the theme supports seamless functionality for literary commerce and event management. Additional features include customizable banners, call-to-action buttons, bestseller showcases, testimonial sections, newsletter subscription integration with Mailchimp, and social media connectivity to enhance engagement and community growth. Its SEO-friendly structure, fast-loading performance, and translation-ready design make it perfect for book clubs, authors, publishers, and reading communities seeking to build a professional, community-driven, and inspiring literary platform that connects readers worldwide and celebrates the joy of books."
    },
